  "title": "Sierra Roamer",
  "date": "2025-03-05",
  "excerpt": "The Sierra Roamer is a sleek and versatile Mercedes Sprinter 144 AWD camper van designed for those who crave adventure without excess. Built with a focus on practicality and efficiency, this van offers the perfect balanc",
  "body": [
    "The Sierra Roamer is a sleek and versatile Mercedes Sprinter 144 AWD camper van designed for those who crave adventure without excess. Built with a focus on practicality and efficiency, this van offers the perfect balance of comfort and mobility for weekend getaways and off-grid escapes. Powered by a 400Ah lithium battery system, a 300W solar array, and a 3000W pure sine wave inverter, The Sierra Roamer is equipped to handle remote destinations while keeping essentials running smoothly. Shore power connectivity and multiple 110V and USB outlets provide additional flexibility, ensuring devices stay charged no matter where the road leads.",
    "Designed to offer comfort in all seasons, this van includes premium Havelock wool insulation, a Nomadic 12V air conditioning unit, a Maxxair Deluxe ceiling fan, and a diesel-powered Espar heater for optimal climate control. The interior is clean and modern, featuring painted shiplap walls, a wood-stained ceiling, dimmable LED lighting, and durable wood-style vinyl flooring for a warm yet minimalistic aesthetic. The queen-sized memory foam bed provides a restful retreat, while swivel captain’s seats and a Lagun adjustable table create a functional and flexible living space.",
    "The kitchen setup is streamlined for simplicity, featuring an acacia butcher block countertop with a pop-up extension, an undermount stainless steel sink with a sink-insert cutting board, and a portable single-burner induction cooktop. For refrigeration, a Dometic CFX3 75DZ cooler with custom cushions doubles as a functional bench, optimizing space without sacrificing convenience. A fold-out table at the sliding door creates the perfect outdoor dining or workspace, seamlessly integrating indoor and outdoor living.",
    "Built for rugged adventures, The Sierra Roamer includes basic fixed side steps, a CA Tuned front bumper, and two heavy-duty FVCO pull-out storage trays for easy gear access. A rear door outdoor shower with hot and cold water adds convenience after a long day on the trails, while a Laveo Dry Flush toilet provides a low-maintenance sanitation solution tucked neatly within its own enclosure. This van was designed for those who want to hit the road with ease, offering all the essentials for a comfortable and capable camper experience.",
    "If you're looking for a custom camper van that fits your lifestyle and adventure needs, reach out to us today to start designing your own build."
  ],
